unded Envenox after a decade split between a software consultancy and a security firm, having watched the same handover fail from both sides.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"15\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:url\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"https://envenox.com/about/leadership/tomas-lindqvist\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"16\\\",{\\\"property\\\":\\\"og:type\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"profile\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"17\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"twitter:card\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"summary_large_image\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"18\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"twitter:title\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Envenox — We build the software. Then we try to break it.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"meta\\\",\\\"19\\\",{\\\"name\\\":\\\"twitter:description\\\",\\\"content\\\":\\\"Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"20\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"icon\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/icon.svg?0887ae5654435afa\\\",\\\"type\\\":\\\"image/svg+xml\\\",\\\"sizes\\\":\\\"any\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$L2f\\\",\\\"21\\\",{}]],\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"digest\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1f:\\\"$1a:metadata\\\"\\n\"])</script></body></html>","rsc":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n3:I[4658,[\"2619\",\"static/chunks/2619-3c9e02e22d10480a.js\",\"4938\",\"static/chunks/4938-ec7db2048e7be43e.js\",\"9393\",\"static/chunks/9393-bd02566ba347fb8d.js\",\"7177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-2f5ee25261e09e61.js\"],\"Nav\"]\n4:I[9766,[],\"\"]\n5:I[9567,[\"2619\",\"static/chunks/2619-3c9e02e22d10480a.js\",\"8039\",\"static/chunks/app/error-77708acc479f8cb3.js\"],\"default\"]\ne:I[7150,[],\"\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/css/864ef3ae0e55d690.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/css/806e8b938e28c0c7.css\",\"style\"]\n2:T9a6,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://envenox.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"Envenox\",\"legalName\":\"Envenox Ltd\",\"url\":\"https://envenox.com\",\"description\":\"Envenox is a software development firm. We design, build and hand over the systems a business runs on — custom software, web applications, ERP, CRM, and the cloud platforms underneath them. What makes the work defensible is that we keep an offensive security practice on staff: our penetration testers read the code our engineers are writing and file findings into the same sprint backlog, so a system arrives already attacked rather than waiting for its first external test. That practice also works on its own, for clients who never buy a line of code from us. We work with regulated organisations across finance, healthcare, logistics and public sector, and we publish our own security posture at /trust.\",\"slogan\":\"We build the software. Then we try to break it.\",\"email\":\"hello@envenox.com\",\"telephone\":\"+44 20 4525 9101\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/envenox\",\"https://github.com/envenox\",\"https://x.com/envenox\"],\"address\":[{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT\",\"addressLocality\":\"London\",\"addressCountry\":\"United Kingdom\"},{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"streetAddress\":\"Level 7, Bay’s Galleria, Gulshan 1, Dhaka 1212\",\"addressLocality\":\"Dhaka\",\"addressCountry\":\"Bangladesh\"}],\"contactPoint\":[{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"emergency\",\"name\":\"Incident response hotline\",\"telephone\":\"+44 20 4525 9100\",\"availableLanguage\":[\"en\"],\"hoursAvailable\":{\"@type\":\"OpeningHoursSpecification\",\"dayOfWeek\":[\"Monday\",\"Tuesday\",\"Wednesday\",\"Thursday\",\"Friday\",\"Saturday\",\"Sunday\"],\"opens\":\"00:00\",\"closes\":\"23:59\"}},{\"@type\":\"ContactPoint\",\"contactType\":\"sales\",\"email\":\"hello@envenox.com\",\"telephone\":\"+44 20 4525 9101\",\"availableLangua